{"id": "EUVD-2026-103035", "enisaUuid": "4736d590-488a-3f47-ae68-ccbcce03aaae", "description": "AllData through 0.7.1 contains an unauthenticated JDBC injection vulnerability that allows remote attackers to open arbitrary database connections by supplying jdbcUrl and jdbcDriverClass values to the data-dts /jobJdbcDatasource/test endpoint. Attackers can supply a MySQL JDBC URL with allowLoadLocalInfile=true pointing to an attacker-controlled server to read arbitrary files from the data-dts host.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:38:52", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T17:38:52", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/alldata-dts-unauthenticated-jdbc-url-injection", "https://github.com/alldatacenter/alldata/blob/alldata-release-0.7.1/moat/studio/data-dts/service-data-dts/src/main/java/com/platform/admin/tool/query/BaseQueryTool.java#L107-L124", "https://github.com/alldatacenter/alldata/blob/alldata-release-0.7.1/moat/studio/data-dts/service-data-dts/src/main/java/com/platform/admin/config/WebSecurityConfiguration.java", "https://github.com/alldatacenter/alldata/blob/alldata-release-0.7.1/moat/studio/data-dts/service-data-dts/src/main/java/com/platform/admin/controller/JobDatasourceController.java#L131-L135", "https://github.com/alldatacenter/alldata", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/alldata-through-0.7.1-unauthenticated-jdbc-injection-via-jobjdbcdatasource-test"], "aliases": ["GHSA-33v5-488r-m83x", "CVE-2026-111613"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.47, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "d7c67da0-845b-383b-adff-810079cc76b3", "product": {"name": "alldata", "vendor": {"name": "alldatacenter"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.7.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "4b08e7db-b8b3-357a-ac66-69da409cb50a", "vendor": {"name": "alldatacenter"}}], "isExploited": false}